[sliver] Each 1.2 mm vertical land is the full-projection face of a 1.8 mm square lip, the nameplate tab's own land. Its tapered nose builds from the bed up to this land, and the lip joins the complete 1.3 mm skirt over its 24 mm run. The measurement is the land height, not a free strip.
